  m_Name: L04_BigBenWestminster
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Cutrium.Presentation::Cutrium.Presentation.Landmark.LandmarkDefinition
  _landmarkId: big-ben-westminster
  _displayTitle: Big Ben and the Palace of Westminster
  _shortDescription: Big Ben is actually the nickname of the Great Bell inside Elizabeth
    Tower, not the tower itself. The neighbouring Palace of Westminster is home to
    the Parliament of the United Kingdom. Rebuilt in the Gothic Revival style after
    the 1834 fire destroyed most of the old palace, its famous clock has marked London's
    rhythm since 1859.
  _sector: London / UNITED KINGDOM
  _displayTitleTurkish: "Big Ben ve Westminster Saray\u0131"
  _shortDescriptionTurkish: "\u201CBig Ben\u201D asl\u0131nda saat kulesinin de\u011Fil,
    Elizabeth Kulesi i\xE7indeki B\xFCy\xFCk \xC7an\u2019\u0131n takma ad\u0131d\u0131r.
    Yan\u0131ndaki Westminster Saray\u0131, Birle\u015Fik Krall\u0131k Parlamentosuna
    ev sahipli\u011Fi yapar. Eski saray\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCk b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCn\xFC yok
    eden 1834 yang\u0131n\u0131ndan sonra Gotik Canlanma \xFCslubunda yeniden kurulan
    kompleksin \xFCnl\xFC saati 1859\u2019dan beri Londra\u2019n\u0131n ritmini belirler."
  _sectorTurkish: "Londra / B\u0130RLE\u015E\u0130K KRALLIK"
  _artwork: {fileID: 7766269430644573550, guid: 0b6b43b598e83bf4ba1cd4d50c96e909, type: 3}
